### Example 2: Create simple service without transactions
```
/command create-service Customer --includeTransactions=false
```
Creates: customers.service.js with basic CRUD

### Example 3: Custom Prisma model name
```
/command create-service DeliveryStaff --prismaModel=delivery_staffs
```
Creates: delivery-staffs.service.js with custom Prisma model
